{
    "name": "L3 - Skill: PRD Generator",
    "description": "Generates comprehensive Product Requirement Documents from briefs, saves to Google Drive",
    "nodes": [
        {
            "parameters": {
                "inputSource": "passthrough"
            },
            "name": "PRD Input",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
            "typeVersion": 1,
            "position": [
                100,
                300
            ],
            "id": "prd-input"
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "model": "models/gemini-2.0-flash",
                "options": {
                    "temperature": 0.3
                }
            },
            "name": "PRD Generator LLM",
            "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
            "typeVersion": 1,
            "position": [
                300,
                300
            ],
            "id": "prd-llm"
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "promptType": "define",
                "text": "You are a senior Product Manager at Fikanova. Generate a comprehensive PRD based on this brief.\n\nBrief: {{$json.message}}\n\n## PRD Template\n\n# Product Requirement Document\n\n## 1. Overview\n- **Product Name**: \n- **Author**: Fikanova CTO Agent\n- **Date**: {{new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0]}}\n- **Version**: 1.0\n\n## 2. Problem Statement\n[What problem does this solve?]\n\n## 3. Goals & Success Metrics\n- Goal 1: \n- Goal 2:\n- KPIs:\n\n## 4. User Stories\n- As a [user], I want to [action], so that [benefit]\n\n## 5. Functional Requirements\n| ID | Requirement | Priority | Notes |\n|----|-------------|----------|-------|\n| FR-1 | | High | |\n\n## 6. Non-Functional Requirements\n- Performance:\n- Security:\n- Scalability:\n\n## 7. Technical Approach\n[High-level architecture]\n\n## 8. Timeline & Milestones\n| Phase | Duration | Deliverables |\n|-------|----------|-------------|\n\n## 9. Risks & Mitigations\n\n## 10. Open Questions\n\n---\nGenerate the full PRD in Markdown format."
            },
            "name": "PRD Prompt",
            "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
            "typeVersion": 1.4,
            "position": [
                300,
                300
            ],
            "id": "prd-prompt",
            "inputs": [
                {
                    "node": "PRD Generator LLM",
                    "type": "ai_language_model",
                    "index": 0
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "jsCode": "const prdContent = items[0].json.text || items[0].json.response || '';\nconst title = prdContent.match(/Product Name[:\\s]*(.*)/i)?.[1]?.trim() || 'Untitled PRD';\nitems[0].json.prd = {\n  title: title,\n  content: prdContent,\n  filename: `PRD_${title.replace(/[^a-zA-Z0-9]/g, '_')}_${new Date().toISOString().split('T')[0]}.md`,\n  generated_at: new Date().toISOString()\n};\nreturn items;"
            },
            "name": "Parse PRD",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
            "typeVersion": 2,
            "position": [
                500,
                300
            ],
            "id": "prd-parse"
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "name": "={{$json.prd.filename}}",
                "driveId": {
                    "__rl": true,
                    "mode": "list",
                    "value": "myDrive"
                },
                "folderId": {
                    "__rl": true,
                    "mode": "id",
                    "value": "={{ $env.GOOGLE_DRIVE_PRD_FOLDER_ID }}"
                },
                "options": {}
            },
            "name": "Upload to Drive",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
            "typeVersion": 3,
            "position": [
                700,
                300
            ],
            "id": "prd-drive-upload"
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "method": "POST",
                "url": "https://api.notion.com/v1/pages",
                "sendHeaders": true,
                "headerParameters": {
                    "parameters": [
                        {
                            "name": "Authorization",
                            "value": "Bearer {{ $env.NOTION_API_KEY }}"
                        },
                        {
                            "name": "Notion-Version",
                            "value": "2022-06-28"
                        },
                        {
                            "name": "Content-Type",
                            "value": "application/json"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                "sendBody": true,
                "specifyBody": "json",
                "jsonBody": "={\n  \"parent\": { \"database_id\": \"{{ $env.NOTION_DATABASE_RESOURCES }}\" },\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"Title\": { \"title\": [{ \"text\": { \"content\": \"{{ $json.prd.title }}\" }}] },\n    \"Type\": { \"select\": { \"name\": \"PRD\" }},\n    \"Status\": { \"select\": { \"name\": \"Draft\" }}\n  }\n}",
                "options": {}
            },
            "name": "Log to Notion",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
            "typeVersion": 4.2,
            "position": [
                900,
                300
            ],
            "id": "prd-notion"
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "jsCode": "return [{\n  json: {\n    success: true,\n    prd_title: items[0].json.prd?.title,\n    filename: items[0].json.prd?.filename,\n    message: `PRD generated: ${items[0].json.prd?.title}`,\n    content_preview: items[0].json.prd?.content?.substring(0, 500) + '...'\n  }\n}];"
            },
            "name": "PRD Response",
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
            "typeVersion": 2,
            "position": [
                1100,
                300
            ],
            "id": "prd-response"
        }
    ],
    "connections": {
        "PRD Input": {
            "main": [
                [
                    {
                        "node": "PRD Prompt",
                        "type": "main",
                        "index": 0
                    }
                ]
            ]
        },
        "PRD Prompt": {
            "main": [
                [
                    {
                        "node": "Parse PRD",
                        "type": "main",
                        "index": 0
                    }
                ]
            ]
        },
        "Parse PRD": {
            "main": [
                [
                    {
                        "node": "Upload to Drive",
                        "type": "main",
                        "index": 0
                    }
                ]
            ]
        },
        "Upload to Drive": {
            "main": [
                [
                    {
                        "node": "Log to Notion",
                        "type": "main",
                        "index": 0
                    }
                ]
            ]
        },
        "Log to Notion": {
            "main": [
                [
                    {
                        "node": "PRD Response",
                        "type": "main",
                        "index": 0
                    }
                ]
            ]
        }
    },
    "settings": {
        "executionOrder": "v1"
    }
}